<li class="relative pl-5 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:text-current [ul_&amp;]:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;] [ol_&amp;]:[counter-increment:item] [ol_&amp;]:before:content-[counter(item)&#x27;)&#x27;] flex flex-col gap-y-(--spacing-sm)"><p class="wrapped">retrieve all users stored in our &#x27;database&#x27;, as JSON array of objects.</p></li>
